  "subQuests": [
    {
      "subId": "2102701",
      "subQuestName": "与小蒙对话",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "210270101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "210270101": {
            "id": "210270101",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "小蒙",
            "text": "#{PLAYERAVATAR#SEXPRO[INFO_MALE_PRONOUN_BIGBROTHER|INFO_FEMALE_PRONOUN_BIGSISTER]}！你来得正好，我正想去找你呢！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210270102"
            ]
          },
          "210270102": {
            "id": "210270102",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "欸？小蒙，你有什么事吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210270103"
            ]
          },
          "210270103": {
            "id": "210270103",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "小蒙",
            "text": "我上次不是拜托你，陪我去放出了一个装着我烦恼的漂流瓶吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210270104"
            ]
          },
          "210270104": {
            "id": "210270104",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "小蒙",
            "text": "本来我都不抱希望了…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210270105"
            ]
          },
          "210270105": {
            "id": "210270105",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "小蒙",
            "text": "但是，前几天我爸爸说，他的一个生意伙伴突然找到了他。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210270106"
            ]
          },
          "210270106": {
            "id": "210270106",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "小蒙",
            "text": "那个叔叔说，他们正在筹划一桩和蘑菇有关的生意，过段时间要去须弥考察。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210270107"
            ]
          },
          "210270107": {
            "id": "210270107",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "小蒙",
            "text": "他们问我爸爸，要不要跟他们一起去看看那边的情况。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210270108"
            ]
          },
          "210270108": {
            "id": "210270108",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "小蒙",
            "text": "还说…可以把我一起带上！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210270109"
            ]
          },
          "210270109": {
            "id": "210270109",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "小蒙",
            "text": "爸爸最开始还不同意，但是…有个叔叔突然拿出了一封信，说要和我爸爸出去单独谈谈。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210270110"
            ]
          },
          "210270110": {
            "id": "210270110",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "小蒙",
            "text": "他们谈完了之后，爸爸就同意带我去须弥了…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210270111"
            ]
          },
          "210270111": {
            "id": "210270111",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "小蒙",
            "text": "唔，虽然不知道为什么爸爸突然改变了主意…但是…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210270112"
            ]
          },
          "210270112": {
            "id": "210270112",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "小蒙",
            "text": "#我可以去须弥旅行了！{PLAYERAVATAR#SEXPRO[INFO_MALE_PRONOUN_BIGBROTHER|INFO_FEMALE_PRONOUN_BIGSISTER]}！我可以去须弥旅行啦！太好了！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210270114",
              "210270116"
            ]
          },
          "210270114": {
            "id": "210270114",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "小蒙",
            "text": "#一定是那个漂流瓶起作用了，谢谢你，{PLAYERAVATAR#SEXPRO[INFO_MALE_PRONOUN_BIGBROTHER|INFO_FEMALE_PRONOUN_BIGSISTER]}！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210270117"
            ]
          },
          "210270117": {
            "id": "210270117",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "小蒙",
            "text": "爸爸说，他们去了须弥之后，还要去一个叫做「翘英庄」的地方。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210270118"
            ]
          },
          "210270118": {
            "id": "210270118",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "翘英庄？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210270119"
            ]
          },
          "210270119": {
            "id": "210270119",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "小蒙",
            "text": "嗯，爸爸说那是一个茶村，种着很多茶树，茶叶的品质也特别好。不过，这个名字可真难记…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210270120"
            ]
          },
          "210270120": {
            "id": "210270120",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "小蒙",
            "text": "先不说这些了！在去那边之前，我们还是要先去须弥的。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210270121"
            ]
          },
          "210270121": {
            "id": "210270121",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "小蒙",
            "text": "须弥离这里也很远，过去肯定要花很长时间。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210270122"
            ]
          },
          "210270122": {
            "id": "210270122",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "小蒙",
            "text": "不过，我听人家说外出旅行要做很多准备，因为只要旅行的时间一长，就会遇见各种情况。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210270123"
            ]
          },
          "210270123": {
            "id": "210270123",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "小蒙",
            "text": "#{PLAYERAVATAR#SEXPRO[INFO_MALE_PRONOUN_BIGBROTHER|INFO_FEMALE_PRONOUN_BIGSISTER]}，你经常在外面旅行，能不能请你教我一些在外旅行的诀窍呀？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210270124"
            ]
          },
          "210270124": {
            "id": "210270124",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "小蒙",
            "text": "比如…嗯…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210270125"
            ]
          },
          "210270125": {
            "id": "210270125",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "小蒙",
            "text": "在外面旅行的时候，一般会吃什么东西呀？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210270126"
            ]
          },
          "210270126": {
            "id": "210270126",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "小蒙",
            "text": "爸爸和我说，他们都是自己做东西吃。可我只会几道简单的菜，也不知道做的好不好…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210270127"
            ]
          },
          "210270127": {
            "id": "210270127",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "#嘿嘿，烹饪可是我们的拿手好戏，对吧？{NICKNAME}。"
          },
          "210270116": {
            "id": "210270116",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "小蒙",
            "text": "真的吗？那我们就须弥见吧！"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2102702",
      "subQuestName": "指导小蒙进行烹饪",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "210270201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "210270201": {
            "id": "210270201",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "卯师傅",
            "text": "旅行者，还有小蒙？你们有什么事吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210270202"
            ]
          },
          "210270202": {
            "id": "210270202",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "小蒙",
            "text": "#啊？呃…那个…那个…{PLAYERAVATAR#SEXPRO[INFO_MALE_PRONOUN_BIGBROTHER|INFO_FEMALE_PRONOUN_BIGSISTER]}…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210270203"
            ]
          },
          "210270203": {
            "id": "210270203",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "我们想要借用一下厨房。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210270204"
            ]
          },
          "210270204": {
            "id": "210270204",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "卯师傅",
            "text": "借用厨房倒是没问题，可你们为什么突然…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210270205"
            ]
          },
          "210270205": {
            "id": "210270205",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "卯师傅",
            "text": "原来是这样…好，你们就去用吧。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210270206"
            ]
          },
          "210270206": {
            "id": "210270206",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "卯师傅",
            "text": "小蒙，去外面旅行的时候，你可不能挑食了。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210270207"
            ]
          },
          "210270207": {
            "id": "210270207",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "小蒙",
            "text": "我、我知道了…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210270208"
            ]
          },
          "210270208": {
            "id": "210270208",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "小蒙",
            "text": "#{PLAYERAVATAR#SEXPRO[INFO_MALE_PRONOUN_BIGBROTHER|INFO_FEMALE_PRONOUN_BIGSISTER]}，那就拜托你了，教我做一道好菜吧。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210270209"
            ]
          },
          "210270209": {
            "id": "210270209",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "小蒙",
            "text": "等我和爸爸去旅行的时候，我一定要给他一个惊喜。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210270210"
            ]
          },
          "210270210": {
            "id": "210270210",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "交给我们吧！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210270211"
            ]
          },
          "210270211": {
            "id": "210270211",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "#{NICKNAME}，我们做什么菜好呢？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2102703",
      "subQuestName": "指导小蒙进行烹饪",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "210271001"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "210271001": {
            "id": "210271001",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "小蒙",
            "text": "#那就拜托{PLAYERAVATAR#SEXPRO[INFO_MALE_PRONOUN_BIGBROTHER|INFO_FEMALE_PRONOUN_BIGSISTER]}了，我先仔细看看这食谱…",
            "nextDialogs": [
