            "text": "甜甜花酿鸡。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210270502"
            ]
          },
          "210270502": {
            "id": "210270502",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "这个好吃！嘿嘿，不过难度会不会有点高呢…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2102706",
      "subQuestName": "将史莱姆凝液交给小蒙",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "210270601"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "210270601": {
            "id": "210270601",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "小蒙",
            "text": "喔…这道食谱好详细啊，字好多…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210270602"
            ]
          },
          "210270602": {
            "id": "210270602",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "唔，不过就这么简单做出来的话，感觉不太能给人惊喜感呢。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210270603"
            ]
          },
          "210270603": {
            "id": "210270603",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "小蒙",
            "text": "欸？那要怎么办？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210270604"
            ]
          },
          "210270604": {
            "id": "210270604",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "不如…我们再往里面加入一点新奇的食材吧。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210270605"
            ]
          },
          "210270605": {
            "id": "210270605",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "但是，要加入什么呢…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2102707",
      "subQuestName": "与小蒙对话",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "210271201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "210271201": {
            "id": "210271201",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "小蒙",
            "text": "#这样材料就齐了，那…就麻烦{PLAYERAVATAR#SEXPRO[INFO_MALE_PRONOUN_BIGBROTHER|INFO_FEMALE_PRONOUN_BIGSISTER]}指导一下我啦。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210271202"
            ]
          },
          "210271202": {
            "id": "210271202",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "小蒙",
            "text": "完成了！"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2102708",
      "subQuestName": "与小蒙对话",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "210271501"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "210271501": {
            "id": "210271501",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "总之，只要学会了基本的做菜方法，接下来只要不断练习就好啦。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210271502"
            ]
          },
          "210271502": {
            "id": "210271502",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "小蒙",
            "text": "#嗯！我会练习的，谢谢你，{PLAYERAVATAR#SEXPRO[INFO_MALE_PRONOUN_BIGBROTHER|INFO_FEMALE_PRONOUN_BIGSISTER]}！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210271503"
            ]
          },
          "210271503": {
            "id": "210271503",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "小蒙",
            "text": "须弥，须弥…嘿嘿，我都要等不及啦。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
